;-------------------------------------------------------------------
;  Revision History:             
;
;   REV      DATE    WHO    ER#   DESCRIPTION OF CHANGE
;--------  --------  ---  ------  --------------------------------------------
; 2.00.00  07-13-15  GTH  xxxxxx  Initial version for Qlipper (based on Baker 1.0.4.0)
; 2.00.01  08-03-15  GTH  xxxxxx  Disable DDRC functionality
; 2.00.02  08-11-15  GTH  xxxxxx  Change the temperature offset
; 2.02.02  10-23-15  GTH  xxxxxx  Change for HP 1 sensor 
; 2.02.03  11-06-15  GTH  xxxxxx  Add mpi support
; 2.02.04  04-28-16  GTH  xxxxxx  Change the temperature limits (per Ekrem), enable BB_CR
; 2.02.05  05-05-16  GTH  xxxxxx  Disable BB_CR
;          0x-0x-1x  GTH  xxxxxx  Add LED fault state, SFP temp fields
; 2.02.06  07-14-16  GTH  139584  Change internal sensor offset to +6 (from -8)
; 2.02.07  08-03-16  GTH  139542  Change Caution and Mcot values
;
;-----------------------------------------------------------------------------

